all of it, from the first commit of this repository. It does not cover the texts listed
in section 2, which come from their publishers and keep whatever terms those publishers give them.

2. Texts from their publishers

2.0 The law: PRC Copyright Law, art. 5

    中华人民共和国著作权法（1990年通过，2020年11月11日第三次修正，2021年6月1日起施行）第五条：
    “本法不适用于：（一）法律、法规，国家机关的决议、决定、命令和其他具有立法、行政、司法性质的文件，及其官方正式
    译文；（二）单纯事实消息；（三）历法、通用数表、通用表格和公式。”

    ("This Law does not apply to: (1) laws and regulations, resolutions, decisions and orders of state organs, and
    other documents of a legislative, administrative or judicial nature, and their official translations; (2) mere
    news of facts; (3) calendars, general numerical tables, general tables and formulas.")
    Source: 中华人民共和国著作权法 (2020年修正), promulgated by 中华人民共和国主席令第六十二号, 2020-11-11.

    The constitution, laws, regulations, rules, judicial interpretations, decisions, gazette items and other
    documents of state organs in this repository are such documents. Only their official text is taken. A site's own
    editorial matter is left out: news, commentary, explanations not issued as part of the document, editorial
    summaries (裁判要旨) and annotations. Mandatory national standards are also left out, because standards are
    copyright-protected in China. The official promulgation (the gazette or the issuing body's own publication) is
    authoritative; where a site says its online text yields to the printed text, that applies here too.

2.1 How site terms are treated

    Every host used was read once on 2026-11-19 for its robots.txt, its home page and its own statement page (版权声明,
    网站声明 or 法律声明, where one is linked). What each one says is given below.
    - Copy and mirror reservations. 64 hosts carry a reservation such as "未经许可，不得复制、转载或建立镜像" ("no
      copying, reprinting or mirroring without permission"). A reservation like this claims the site's own copyright.
      Under art. 5 it cannot extend to the official documents, so only those documents are taken, never the site's
      own editorial content. This is the same rule as for Germany's text-and-data-mining notices (official works,
      § 5 UrhG).
    - A written ban on automated collection is a different matter. Such a host is not used until its operator
      answers (flk.npc.gov.cn, below).
    - A robots.txt that disallows all clients is recorded. It is treated as advisory. These hosts do that: mp.weixin.qq.com, public.zhengzhou.gov.cn, www.baoding.gov.cn, www.bjsrd.gov.cn, www.dandong.gov.cn, www.lnkd.gov.cn, www.moa.gov.cn, www.mofcom.gov.cn, www.pbc.gov.cn, www.sjzrd.gov.cn, www.zhengzhou.gov.cn, xiamen.pbc.gov.cn.
    - Pace: at least 10 seconds between requests to a host, or the host's own stated limit if it is longer; one
      request at a time. Any refusal (HTTP 401, 403, 412 or 429), challenge page or login wall stops the host for
      good, and nothing is fetched from it by any other route.

2.2 National sources

    中国人大网 www.npc.gov.cn (全国人大常委会办公厅主办，《中国人大》杂志社承办)
      The source of the laws and the Constitution now in this repository (宪法/, 法律/; the texts as published on
      its pages and in the 全国人大常委会公报 PDFs it hosts, /wxzlhgb/). No reuse terms are stated on the pages
      read; its statement page is not reachable without scripts (checked 2026-11-19). Laws and decisions: art. 5.

    国家法律法规数据库 flk.npc.gov.cn
      Copyright line: "版权所有：全国人大常委会办公厅" (site footer, read 2026-11-19). Its robots.txt begins
      "#禁止使用任何自动化工具、脚本、爬虫程序采集或复制网站数据" ("collecting or copying site data with any automated
      tool, script or crawler is prohibited"), then disallows every client. NOT FETCHED: held until the office answers
      Lexifina's request. The texts themselves are art. 5 documents; since 2026-11-20 flk's own Word files
      are taken from third-party mirrors (2.5).

    中国政府网 www.gov.cn (国务院办公厅): 国务院公报 (State Council Gazette, /gongbao/), 国家规章库, policy documents
      网站声明 https://www.gov.cn/home/2014-02/23/content_5046258.htm (read 2026-11-19):
      "本网站内容由中央和地方各级政府、政府网站以及相关单位提供。任何媒体、互联网站和商业机构不得利用本网站发布的内容
      进行商业性的原版原式地转载，也不得歪曲和篡改本网站所发布的内容。本网站所涉及到的版权归本网站所属。本网站提供的
      资料如与相关纸质文本不符，以纸质文本为准。任何媒体或互联网站不得擅自转载本网站由其他单位提供的信息和服务内容，
      如需转载，必须与相应提供单位直接联系获得合法授权。"
      ("Media, websites and commercial bodies may not reprint this site's content commercially in its original form,
      or distort or alter it; copyright in the site's own content is the site's; where material differs from the
      printed text, the printed text prevails; content provided by other units may not be reprinted without their
      authorisation.") Taken here: only gazette items and documents of state organs (art. 5), unaltered and named
      by source; the printed gazette prevails.

    国家行政法规库 xzfg.moj.gov.cn (司法部)
      No terms stated (checked 2026-11-19; no robots.txt, no statement page linked). Administrative regulations: art. 5.

    司法部 / 中国政府法制信息网 www.moj.gov.cn
